  "body": "The post-merge gate run 43709471112 on `7c514c874` failed. The batch tier has one failed test.\n\n- Test: `a_tapered_punch_is_refused_at_post_while_the_file_states_no_guide_heights`\n- File: `crates/app/tests/sodick_alc400g.rs`, line 140\n- Step: `app suites (slow, release tier: center_cut_multiaxis)`\n- The run log does not show the panic text. The text is in the gate logs of the runner.\n\nThe last green run was on `db091cb38`. These merges are between the two runs: PR #517, PR #1772, PR #1818, PR #1823.\n\nThe test pins a refusal at post. If the post now writes a program for a tapered punch without guide heights, the output is wrong. For that reason the priority is `P1`. Change it to `P2` if the failure is only in the test.\n\nThe `report` job did not open this issue because of #1611.\n\nThe next run is on `62e1d36a6` (merge batch of PR #1834, PR #1846, PR #1780, PR #518).\n\nDone means: the test passes on `main`, the cause is named in a comment, and a post-merge run is green.\n",
